    <heading>EXAMPLE 3</heading>
    <div class="description-paragraph">This example illustrates the deposition of the nickel on the surface of a microporous film using a cellulose acetate matrix polymer in a lacquer coating. Thus, the following components are mixed together as shown at Table 3.</div>
    <div class="description-paragraph">
      </div> <pre xml:space="preserve" listing-type="tabular">              TABLE 3                                                     
